---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Become a tutor — teach online | LearnNest" description="Teach a language online with LearnNest. Set your own price and hours, meet students worldwide. Demo application only — nothing is sent." path="/become-a-tutor">
  <h1>Become a tutor on LearnNest</h1>
  <p class="lede">Share a language you know well, set your own price and hours, and teach students from anywhere — 1-to-1, online.</p>
  <p class="demo-note"><strong>Demo application:</strong> the form below is a demonstration. It sends nothing and creates no tutor account.</p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><h3>Sign up</h3><p>Create your tutor profile: tell us about yourself, the language you teach, and who you teach best.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><h3>Get approved</h3><p>In a real marketplace our team would review your profile, photo and short intro video, usually within a few business days.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><h3>Start earning</h3><p>Set your hours, meet students in trial lessons, and teach regularly. You keep teaching; we handle the bookings and payments in the real product.</p></div>
  </div>

  <h2>What you need</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Be 18 or older.</li>
    <li>A laptop or desktop computer, a webcam, a microphone, and a stable internet connection.</li>
    <li>A clear photo of yourself and a short video introduction (up to 2 minutes) in the real product.</li>
    <li>A written description of your strengths as a tutor, your experience, and who your lessons suit.</li>
    <li>No teaching certificate is required to apply in the real product — good communication and a personal approach matter most.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Set your own rate</h2>
  <p>You choose your hourly price and can change it at any time. In this demo, sample tutors charge $8 to $45 per 50-minute lesson.</p>
  <p><strong>Example, labelled as an example:</strong> a tutor charging $20 per lesson who teaches 10 lessons a week would earn $200 a week before any platform share. Real earnings depend on your price, your hours, and how many students book you — nothing here is a promise of income.</p>

  <h2>Teach anytime, anywhere</h2>
  <p>Decide when and how many hours you want to teach. There is no minimum time commitment and no fixed schedule in the real product. You are your own boss.</p>

  <h2>Demo application</h2>
  <p>Fill this in to see how an application would look. It is saved in your own browser only — nothing is sent to anyone.</p>
  <form class="demo-form" id="tutor-form">
    <div><label for="t-name">Your name<input id="t-name" name="name" type="text" required autocomplete="name" /></label></div>
    <div><label for="t-email">Email<input id="t-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" /></label></div>
    <div><label for="t-lang">Language you teach<select id="t-lang" name="language"><option>English</option><option>Spanish</option><option>French</option><option>German</option><option>Italian</option><option>Portuguese</option><option>Arabic</option><option>Mandarin Chinese</option><option>Japanese</option><option>Korean</option><option>Urdu</option><option>Hindi</option><option>Another language</option></select></label></div>
    <div><label for="t-rate">Your price per 50-min lesson (USD)<input id="t-rate" name="rate" type="number" min="5" max="100" value="20" required /></label></div>
    <div><label for="t-about">Tell students about yourself<textarea id="t-about" name="about" rows="4" required placeholder="Who do you teach, and what happens in your lessons?"></textarea></label></div>
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Submit demo application</button>
  </form>
  <div class="confirm-box" id="tutor-done" hidden>
    <p><strong>Demo application saved in your browser!</strong></p>
    <p>Reference: <strong id="tutor-ref"></strong></p>
    <p>Nothing was sent to anyone. In the real product this is where your profile would go for review.</p>
  </div>
  <script>
    document.getElementById('tutor-form').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var ref = 'LN-APP-' + String(Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000));
      var app = {
        reference: ref,
        name: document.getElementById('t-name').value.trim(),
        email: document.getElementById('t-email').value.trim(),
        language: document.getElementById('t-lang').value,
        rate: document.getElementById('t-rate').value,
        about: document.getElementById('t-about').value.trim(),
        created: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)
      };
      try {
        if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.localStorage) {
          var list = JSON.parse(window.localStorage.getItem('learnnest_applications') || '[]');
          list.push(app);
          window.localStorage.setItem('learnnest_applications', JSON.stringify(list));
        }
      } catch (err) { /* demo storage unavailable in this browser */ }
      document.getElementById('tutor-ref').textContent = ref;
      document.getElementById('tutor-done').hidden = false;
      document.getElementById('tutor-done').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
